# (P2c slice i3) sp_brace: the spear block redrawn (STYLE_P2 25.8 item 7): the knees bent (legs buckle), the haft raised
# across the body steeply in front (facing right a067, left a112; down a045 across the chest, up a135 behind), the rear
# fist low before the belly, the off fist high on the haft (C3d within 1 px). sp_block above is the iteration-2 pose,
